1
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:07,480
你去哪儿了？我给你打了三次电话。
Where have you been? I called you three times.

2
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:13,680
我知道，我知道。车在回来的路上坏了。
I know, I know. The car broke down on the way back.

3
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:19,740
你至少可以给我发个消息吧。
You could have sent me a message at least.

4
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:26,500
我的手机没电了。对不起，好吗？
My phone was dead. I'm sorry, all right?

5
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:34,920
你想吃点东西吗？炉子上有汤。
Do you want something to eat? There is soup on the stove.

6
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:43,740
不用了，谢谢。我只是需要坐一会儿。
No, thanks. I just need to sit down for a minute.

7
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:47,840
你的手怎么了？
What happened to your hand?

8
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:54,500
没什么。我换轮胎的时候割破了。
It's nothing. I cut it when I was fixing the tire.

9
00:01:56,700 --> 00:02:00,480
让我看看。看起来很深。
Let me see it. That looks deep.

10
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:07,100
真的没那么疼。
It doesn't hurt that much, really.

11
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:14,720
你爸爸今天下午来过。
Your father was here this afternoon.

12
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:18,160
他想干什么？
What did he want?

13
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:24,580
他说想跟你谈谈房子的事。
He said he wanted to talk to you about the house.

14
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:31,580
我跟他说了我不想卖。现在不行。
I told him I don't want to sell it. Not now.

15
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:39,340
他觉得这对我们大家都是最好的。
He thinks it is the best thing for all of us.

16
00:02:42,940 --> 00:02:48,340
他总觉得自己知道什么对每个人最好。
He always thinks he knows what is best for everyone.

17
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:52,620
也许这次他是对的。
Maybe he is right this time.

18
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:57,420
你现在站在他那边了？
Are you on his side now?

19
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:04,060
我谁也不站。我只是累了。
I'm not on anyone's side. I'm just tired.

20
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:11,580
如果你愿意，我们明天再谈。
We can talk about it tomorrow, if you want.

21
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:18,780
明天我得早起上班。
Tomorrow I have to work early.

22
00:03:19,580 --> 00:03:23,300
那我们晚上再说。
Then we will talk in the evening.

23
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:28,000
你看到银行寄来的信了吗？
Did you see the letter from the bank?

24
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:36,180
看到了。我把它和其他的放在抽屉里了。
Yes. I put it in the drawer with the others.

25
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:43,640
我们必须在月底之前付款。
We have to pay before the end of the month.

26
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:51,620
我知道。我会想办法弄到钱的。
I know. I will find the money somehow.

27
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:56,500
怎么弄？你上次也是这么说的。
How? You said that last time too.

28
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:02,440
求你了，别再说了。今晚不要。
Please, don't start again. Not tonight.

29
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:09,380
我只是因为担心你才问的。
I'm only asking because I'm worried about you.

30
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:15,580
我知道。谢谢你。
I know you are. Thank you.
